#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:15
msgid "Build Configurations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:17
msgid ""
"There are 3 types (:ref:`projectconf_build_type`) of build configuration in "
"PlatformIO:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:0
msgid "``release``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Default configuration**. A \"release\" configuration of your firmware/"
"program does not contain symbolic debug information and is optimized for the "
"firmware size or speed (depending on :ref:`platforms`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:0
msgid "``test``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:27
msgid ""
"A \"test\" configuration extends a build environment with "
"``PIO_UNIT_TESTING`` macro and with extra flags provided by the :ref:"
"`unit_testing` framework"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:0
msgid "``debug``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:31
msgid ""
"A \"debug\" configuration of your firmware/program is compiled with full "
"symbolic debug information and no optimization. Optimization complicates "
"debugging because the relationship between source code and generated "
"instructions is more complex."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:37
msgid ""
"If you need to control build flags that are specific for debug configuration "
"please refer to :ref:`projectconf_debug_build_flags`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:40
msgid ""
"If you need to build a project in ``debug`` configuration, please use one of "
"these options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:43
msgid ""
"In :ref:`ide_vscode`: Use build option **Pre-Debug** or **Pre-Debug All** in "
"the ``Project Tasks`` menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:44
msgid ""
"Add :ref:`projectconf_build_type` with ``debug`` value to :ref:`projectconf`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:45
msgid "Use :ref:`cmd_debug` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:48
msgid ""
":ref:`piodebug` automatically switches to ``debug`` configuration when you "
"do project debugging from :ref:`pioide` or use the :ref:`cmd_debug` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:51
msgid ""
"To avoid having :ref:`piodebug` rebuild the project, please create a "
"separate build environment that defines ``build_type = debug``. See the "
"example below where the ``mydebug`` build environment will be used "
"automatically by :ref:`piodebug`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projectconf/build_configurations.rst:71
msgid ""
"Please note that you can set a default build environment per a project using "
"the :ref:`projectconf_pio_default_envs` option in :ref:"
"`projectconf_section_platformio`."
msgstr ""
